# Team default is versioned in `.env.development` (loaded by `npm run dev`).
# This file is documentation / Vercel template only — Vite does NOT load `.env.example`.
#
# Guide: docs/security-public-deployment.md
#        knowledge/context/modules/remote_backend.md
#
# Shared staging API:
VITE_API_URL=https://dev1.corp.curatech.pk/halite-api/api
#
# Website users authenticate interactively at `/login` (short-lived JWT + rotating refresh session),
# so `VITE_HALITE_API_KEY` should remain UNSET in public Vercel deployments.
# Optional local dev/script override only (gitignored `.env.local`):
# VITE_API_URL=/api
# VITE_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:8000
